      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As painful as it is the current 2D image makes sense for performance. If you as a world creator want to show the 3D avatar, you can do that very easily yourself. Do not let vrchat do it automatically because then it will need to download the whole avatar and potentially spend more time removing unnecessary components to save performance. \nIts just overall easier for world creators to do it themselves.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
