  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-05-13T15:27:21.858Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When creating avatar pedestals I'd like to have the ability to have it show the full 3D avatar and not just a 2D render of said avatar. To prevent this from completely killing the server, make it act like you would with the mirror, click on it or a button next to it to flip from 2D render we have now to the 3D full body render.\n\nAlso please make them change stances and move around a bit so they look more lively.",
